{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测Linux疑似sudo CVE-2019-14287提权。对应需求：安全检测。官方：Potential Sudo Privilege Escalation via CVE-2019-14287。","from":"now-9m","index":["auditbeat-*","endgame-*","logs-auditd_manager.auditd-*","logs-crowdstrike.fdr*","logs-endpoint.events.process*","logs-sentinel_one_cloud_funnel.*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Linux疑似sudo CVE-2019-14287提权","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nLinux疑似sudo CVE-2019-14287提权\n\n### 为何重要\n可能表示异常活动\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对进程名、命令行、父进程与用户。\n2. 核对路径、外连地址与是否符合变更窗口。\n3. 关联同主机前后同类告警、落地文件与持久化。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、开发或自动化脚本\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离主机、终止可疑进程并排查落地文件。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警与外连。\n","references":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/47502"],"risk_score":73,"rule_id":"8af5b42f-8d74-48c8-a8d0-6d14b4197288","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（按规则需要进程/网络/文件事件）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","severity":"high","tags":["操作系统: Linux","主题: 安全检测","来源: 默认","对应需求: 安全检测"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"eql","query":"process where host.os.type == \"linux\" and event.type == \"start\" and\n  event.action in (\"exec\", \"exec_event\", \"start\", \"ProcessRollup2\", \"executed\", \"process_started\") and\n  process.name == \"sudo\" and process.args == \"-u#-1\"\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1068","name":"Exploitation for Privilege Escalation","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1068/"},{"id":"T1548","name":"Abuse Elevation Control Mechanism","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1548/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1548.003","name":"Sudo and Sudo Caching","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1548/003/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0004","name":"Privilege Escalation","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0004/"}}],"false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、开发或自动化脚本"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"},{"package":"auditd_manager","version":"*"},{"package":"